# X1: a paste whose end marker shares a read with Enter. One `type` carries
# all of it, so it lands in one read: fx c1db919 refuses the paste and drops
# the Enter (`paste_framing.zig:160-167`); v0.0.16 keeps the paste instead
# (9e0eab41), which is Phase 5's. Copied from the Phase 5 research
# (`p5-input-paste.cap`), the keystrokes byte for byte.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 4
type prior
wait 0.5
type [200~new[201~
wait 1.5
snap paste-enter
snapfull paste-enter
gwlog
